license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.4.0"
abstract: >-
  A Rust research harness for voluntary partner selection and explicit model-fusion
  agreements among language-model participants. It records bounded communication,
  private self-reports, sealed nominations and pending fusion requests with offline
  replay. It does not execute weight fusion or establish model experience.
keywords:
  - language models
  - partner selection
  - reproducible research
  - model merging
